===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|burjon|burjon, burioun|lang=enm}} "shoot, bud" from {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|burjun|burjun, burgeon, burgon|lang=fro}} (compare {{etyl|fro|-}} {{term|burjon||lang=fro}} "a bud"), from {{etyl|frk|en}} {{recons|burjo|burjo|sprout, offshoot, descendant|lang=frk}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{recons|burjô||sprout, descendant, offshoot|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{recons|beranan||to carry, bear|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{recons|bʰer-|lang=ine-pro}}, {{recons|bʰrē-||to bear|lang=ine-pro}}. Akin to {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|burjan||to push up, raise|lang=goh}}, {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|byrian||to come up, occur|lang=ang}}, {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|byre||child, son, descendant|lang=ang}}. More at {{l/en|bear}}.

